{
  "//": "Change-scope config for compose-ai-tools/apply. PRs whose changes all live inside modules under scopedRoots render only those modules plus their transitive Gradle dependents; PRs that only touch ignorePaths skip the preview pipelines. Global build files (gradle/libs.versions.toml, build-logic, root build scripts, CI) fail open to a full render.",
